OL,3,AMicrosoft says attempts to fix global
OL,4,Aoutage not going 'as expected'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMicrosoft is struggling to fix a global
OL,7,Foutage that is reportedly affecting
OL,8,Ftens of thousands of users
OL,10,FServices including Teams, Outlook and
OL,11,FAI software Copilot have been affected
OL,12,Fby "connectivity problems". Microsoft
OL,13,Fsays the outage is unlikely to have
OL,14,Fcome from a cyber-attack
OL,16,FA monitoring website reports the outage
OL,17,Fis affecting users in 74 countries and
OL,18,Fhas been going on for more than eight
OL,19,Fhours
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
