OL,3,AMicrosoft says attempts to fix global
OL,4,Aoutage not going 'as expected'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMicrosoft says its attempts to fix the
OL,7,Fissue are not "taking as expected" - it
OL,8,Fhad said earlier its team is "seeing
OL,9,Fpositive results"
OL,11,FIf this is not a cyber-attack, it is
OL,12,F"incredible incompetence", a technology
OL,13,Fexpert tells the BBC
OL,15,FMore than 430 million people use
OL,16,FMicrosoft 365 apps
